abstract: >-
  A GraphRAG system that joins MITRE ATT&CK v20.0 (Enterprise) to the AnnoCTR
  threat reports in a Neo4j knowledge graph, extracts and links ATT&CK mentions
  with evidence sentences, and answers multi-hop questions with a citation after
  every statement. Term project for CS 6338 Knowledge Engineering, Angelo State
  University, October 2026.
